      <ul class="bk-points">
        <li><strong>Customer</strong>Submits documents and information securely.</li>
        <li><strong>Loan Officer</strong>Reviews, collects and prepares the file.</li>
        <li><strong>Underwriter / Commercial Banking</strong>Evaluates the request and coordinates approvals.</li>
        <li><strong>Risk Management</strong>Assesses risk and provides analysis.</li>
        <li><strong>Compliance &amp; Legal</strong>Confirm obligations and finalize agreements.</li>
        <li><strong>Protected by Zero Trust Data Access</strong>The right people get the right access to every document, every time.</li>
